<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RTZ-CRA year net US$1.1 bln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RTZ-CRA year net US$1.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (adjusted)			  78.3   vs   103.3</p>
<p>    Total dividend (pence)		31.71  vs    31.50</p>
<p>    Total dividend (Australian cents) 65.05  vs    60.47</p>
<p>    Net adjusted earnings		 1,096  vs   1,441</p>
<p>    Net adjusted earnings (stg)	   701  vs     913</p>
<p>    Net adjusted earnings (A$)	  1,403  vs   1,945</p>
<p>    Turnover				  7,07   vs   8,140</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast adjusted earnings for the mining group in a range between US$1.06 and $1.14 billion. RTZ Corp Plc-CRA Ltd is an Anglo-Australian mining group.</p>
<p>    Exceptional charges		    nil   vs     215</p>
<p>    Interest payable			  33   vs	 6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1,731   vs   2,247</p>
<p>    Tax					  548   vs     832</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
